        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Joramu mwana wa-Ahabu wakaba mwami wa-Israyeli mu-Samariya mumwaka wakumi amusanu aitatu wabwami bwa-Josafati mwami wa­ Juda, nkabela wakeendelezya myaka iili ikumi aibili. ",
          "type": "text",
