        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela Elisha wakaambila mwami wa-Israyeli kuti, Ndijisi makaninzi ayebo. Koya kubasinsimi bauso akubasinsimi babanyoko, Pele mwami wa-Israyeli wakamwaambila kuti, Pe, nkaambo Jehova nguwakaita bami aba botatwe kuti abaabe mumaanza aaba-Moabu. ",
          "type": "text",
