        },
        {
          "text": "Lino Elisha wakati, Ncobeni Jehova wamakamu mbali muumi, ngunjiminide kubusyu bwakwe, nindatakali kulemeka Josafati mwami wa-Juda, nindatakulanga nikuba kukubona. ",
          "type": "text",
