        {
          "text": "Nkaambo mbuboobu mbwaamba Jehova. Tamukooyoobona muuwo, nikuba kubona imvula, nekubaboobo ako kalonga kayoozula maanzi, aboobo munooyoonywa, nywebo aŋombe zyanu abanyama bamwi. ",
