        {
          "text": "Minzi yoonse iijisi malambo aminzi yoonse mibotu muyooizunda, ayalo misamu mibotu yoonse muyooitema, atusensa twamaanzi toonse muyootusinka, amyuunda yoonse mibotu muyooizuzya mabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
