        {
          "text": "­Alimwi minzi yoonse bakainyonyoona, ayalo myuunda mibotu yoonse bakawaala mabwe akwiizuzya, atusensa twamaanzi bakatusinka, amisamu yoonse mibotu bakaitema, mane kwakasyaala mabwe luzutu ku-Kirihareseti, elyo basinkwilipo bakauzyunguluka akuunyonyoona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
