              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpawo mwami waMoabu naakabona kuti inkondo yamuyumina, wakalibwezela bantu basimapanga bali myanda iili musanu aibili kuti aindilile akusika kumwami waEdomu, nekubaboobo wakakacilwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.26",
